OL,3,GNEWSATree felling goes ahead despite
OL,4,Acampaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo trees at the centre of a campaign
OL,7,Fto save them have been chopped down.
OL,9,FNottingham City Council approved the
OL,10,Fremoval of two trees outside The Jamia
OL,11,FMasjid Sultania and Education Centre in
OL,12,FSneinton, Nottingham, on Wednesday.
OL,14,FThe mosque previously said it had
OL,15,Freluctantly applied to chop them down
OL,16,Fbecause of health and safety and
OL,17,Fstructural concerns.
OL,19,FBut Kerry Warwick, 42, who lives in the
OL,20,Farea, said she was "heartbroken" when
OL,21,Fshe arrived on Friday to find stumps
OL,22,Fwhere the trees had stood.
